sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant DVC as DVC
    participant Trainer as Trainer (train_model.py)
    participant MLflow as MLflow/DagsHub
    participant Artifact as Artifact Store (S3/DVC remote)

    Dev->>DVC: prepare & push raw data / params
    DVC->>Trainer: provide processed data
    Trainer->>Trainer: preprocess, fit, evaluate
    Trainer->>Artifact: save model artifacts (models/, preprocessor)
    Trainer->>MLflow: log metrics & register model
    MLflow->>Artifact: reference artifacts
